"Use REAL photographic images, not cartoon icons or abstract symbols. Real photos of familiar objects are much easier for CVI users to recognize. The Image Tool can help you find and prepare these." = "使用真實照片，不要卡通圖示或抽象符號。熟悉物體的照片對 CVI 使用者更容易辨認。圖片工具可協助尋找與準備。";
"Use RED or YELLOW text — these high-contrast colors are typically the easiest for CVI users to see. You can also make text bold and add a colored text border/outline for extra definition." = "使用紅色或黃色文字——對 CVI 使用者通常最易看見。也可加粗並加上彩色描邊。";
"Use This Emoji" = "使用此表情";
"Use a BLACK background — dark backgrounds reduce visual clutter and help the foreground content stand out." = "使用黑色背景——深色背景減少視覺雜亂，讓前景更突出。";
"Use eye movements to control the cursor (more precise)" = "用眼球運動控制游標（更精確）";
"Use head movements to control the cursor" = "用頭部動作控制游標";
"Use iPad language" = "使用 iPad 語言";
"Use one switch per phrase on screen (%d total)." = "螢幕上每條語句一個開關（共 %d 個）。";
"Use touch only, no head or eye tracking" = "僅使用觸控，不進行頭或眼追蹤";
"Use two switches to scan and select phrases." = "用兩個開關掃描並選擇語句。";
"Use your device's emoji keyboard" = "使用裝置的表情鍵盤";
"Uses %d phrases per page from Display settings. Each switch speaks one tile (left-to-right, top-to-bottom)." = "使用顯示設定中的每頁 %d 條語句。每個開關朗讀一個格子（由左至右、由上至下）。";
