"Videos" = "影片";
"Videos must be 20 seconds or shorter. Longer files are not attached." = "影片不得超過 20 秒。更長的檔案不會附加。";
"Wait for each point to complete" = "等待每個點完成";
"Waiting for switch" = "等待開關";
"We collect ZERO information. This app does not collect personal information, track usage analytics, send crash reports, connect to external servers, use cookies or tracking technologies, collect advertising identifiers, access your location, or store or transmit camera or microphone data." = "我們收集零資訊。不收集個人資訊、使用分析、當機報告，不連線外部伺服器，不使用 Cookie 或廣告識別碼，不存取位置，不儲存或傳輸相機或麥克風資料。";
"We share NO data with anyone. This app uses no third-party services — no analytics platforms, no crash reporting, no advertising networks, no cloud services." = "我們不與任何人分享資料。無第三方服務——無分析、當機報告、廣告網路或雲端服務。";
"Welcome to Switch2GO" = "歡迎使用 Switch2GO";
"When a phrase with “Send switch output” is selected, the iPad pulses GPIO 26 on the ESP32. Wire that pin through a relay or optocoupler to the PowerLink switch jack." = "選擇帶「傳送開關輸出」的語句時，iPad 會向 ESP32 的 GPIO 26 發送脈衝。請將該接腳經繼電器或光耦接到 PowerLink 開關口。";
"When editing a phrase's image, you can open the Image Tool — a built-in web tool that helps you find and prepare the perfect picture for any phrase." = "編輯語句圖片時，可開啟圖片工具——內建網頁工具，幫你找到並準備合適的圖片。";
"When this phrase is selected, pulse the paired ESP32 so a PowerLink can toggle a device (fan, light)." = "選擇此語句時，向已配對的 ESP32 發送脈衝，以便 PowerLink 開關裝置（風扇、燈）。";
"When you attach a video, audio, or game to a phrase, it starts after a short delay (%@) so another phrase can be selected first. Change this anytime in Settings → Timing & Sensitivity." = "為語句附加影片、音訊或遊戲後，會在短暫延遲（%@）後開始，以便先選其他語句。可隨時在設定 → 時間與靈敏度中變更。";
"White" = "白";
"Working…" = "處理中…";
"XL" = "特大";
"XXL" = "超大";
"Yellow" = "黃";
"Yes" = "是";
"You can add, edit, reorder, and delete categories and phrases from Settings → Edit Categories & Phrases." = "可在設定 → 編輯類別與語句中新增、編輯、重排和刪除類別與語句。";
"You can also add a high-contrast colored outline around the object. Choose from colors like red, yellow, black, white, blue, green, and more, and adjust the outline thickness. This helps the subject stand out clearly." = "還可以替物體加上高對比彩色描邊。可選紅、黃、黑、白、藍、綠等，並調整粗細，讓主體更突出。";
"You can also assign a specific background color to each symbol position (e.g. red for top-left, blue for top-right). Consistent position colors help users learn where to look." = "還可以替每個符號位置指定背景色（例如左上紅色、右上藍色）。固定的位置顏色幫助使用者知道該往哪看。";
"You can switch between modes at any time -- the app will remember your last choice." = "可隨時切換模式——App 會記住上次選擇。";
"You can use Switch2GO in almost any orientation. The only unsupported position is when the front camera is upside down." = "幾乎任何方向都可以使用 Switch2GO。唯一不支援的是前置相機朝下倒置。";
